armSNES-pico patch to upstream armSNES (libretro/libretro.c), GPL-2.0-or-later like the file it changes.
Copyright (c) 2026 TheGammaSqueeze. Applied by build.sh to a copy in out/src.

With ARMSNES_HOST_NO_HD the port makes no HD Mode 7 picture, no widescreen picture and no NTSC/PAL
filter picture: the LK shows a picture up to the console's hires size (512 x 478), and those are all
larger. The three options read Off whatever is set. Their room is not made either: the HD pictures
upstream allocates as every game starts (7.3 MB for up to 4x), the widescreen rows (1.8 MB) and the
filtered picture (1.4 MB).

